ay, by measuring microseisms on USGS scans of World-Wide Standardized Seismographic Network film chips (about 3.7 million single-day records from 1962-78, about 5% of the archive).</p><p>Status: not started. No measurements or trends from this project are present yet.</p><p>Directed by Ahraz Arifuddin</p><p>Researched and verified by different model families across Gemini, Claude, Grok, OpenAI, and Muse</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Arifuddin, Ahraz", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["climate", "data-rescue", "foundation0", "microseisms", "ocean-waves", "seismology"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/wwssn-microseisms", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/wwssn-microseisms"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "apache2.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "24146115"}}]}}, "title": "wwssn-microseisms", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146116", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146116?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146116", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146116", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24146116", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146115", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146115", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146115", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24146115", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24146116/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24146116/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146116/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/requests"}, "updated": "2026-11-11T20:53:26.981950+00:00", "recid": "24146116", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "93fe633c-1da6-4014-bd9e-2e6fc591a157", "key": "Foundation-0/wwssn-microseisms-v1.0.0.zip", "size": 35070, "checksum": "md5:e586deeb52b77894b4160802a52d2d6f", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146116/files/Foundation-0/wwssn-microseisms-v1.0.0.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1936469"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 2, "unique_downloads": 2, "views": 2, "unique_views": 2, "version_downloads": 2, "version_unique_downloads": 2, "version_unique_views": 2, "version_views": 2}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-11-11T20:54:29.817840+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-11T20:54:29.996769+00:00", "id": 24146136, "conceptrecid": "24146135", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146136", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146135", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146136", "metadata": {"title": "rism-anon", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146136", "publication_date": "2026-11-11", "description": "<p>This repository finds anonymous music manuscripts in RISM that open with the same melody as a work RISM attributes to a named composer, and offers the pairs to RISM's editors. Matches are candidates, not attributions.</p><p>Status: pilot, claimed, not peer reviewed.</p><p>A claimed re-run on the 1 Oct 2026 export found that 13,696 of 138,817 anonymous records with a usable incipit open with the same 12 notes as attributed records by exactly one composer. No match has been checked by a person.</p><p>The counts come from RISM's monthly open-data export, which is under CC BY 3.0. The data are RISM's. They are not redistributed here, and the export is not in this archive.</p><p>Directed by Ahraz Arifuddin</p><p>Researched and verified by different model families across Gemini, Claude, Grok, OpenAI, and Muse</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Arifuddin, Ahraz", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["attribution", "digital-humanities", "foundation0", "music-manuscripts", "musicology", "rism"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/rism-anon", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/rism-anon"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "apache2.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "24146135"}}]}}, "title": "rism-anon", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146136", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146136", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146136?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146136", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146136", "self