er GF(7), with two independent arithmetic checks and a written proof; human review is pending.</p><p>It tightens four displayed upper bounds (for n=55, k=10 from 40 to 39; n=56, k=10 from 41 to 40; n=56, k=11 from 40 to 39; n=57, k=11 from 41 to 40, as displayed on 25 Oct 2026) using a classical method. It does not establish priority, construct a better code, or close the gaps to the known lower bounds.</p><p>Directed by Ahraz Arifuddin</p><p>Researched and verified by different model families across Gemini, Claude, Grok, OpenAI, and Muse</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Arifuddin, Ahraz", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["codetables", "coding-theory", "combinatorics", "finite-fields", "foundation0", "linear-codes"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/gfq-codes", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/gfq-codes"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "apache2.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "24146083"}}]}}, "title": "gfq-codes", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146084", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146084", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146084?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146084", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146084", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24146084", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146084/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146083", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146083", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146083", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24146083", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24146084/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence":